Third-party notices for reqly 2.0.0

The obfuscated WebSocket transport (src/transport.ts) follows the design of
mtproto-workers by bunizao (MIT License), in particular the stateful AES-CTR
stream with partial-block carry. The AES-256-IGE implementation in
src/crypto.ts is original TypeScript written for reqly.

